+### Telemetry
+
+| Environment Variable | Default | Description |
+|---|---|---|
+| `HF_XET_TELEMETRY_ENABLED` | `true` | Send one anonymous transfer summary per upload or download (byte counts, dedup effectiveness, throughput; no names, paths or hashes). Also disabled by `HF_HUB_DISABLE_TELEMETRY`, `DISABLE_TELEMETRY`, `DO_NOT_TRACK`, `HF_HUB_OFFLINE` or `TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE`. |
+| `HF_XET_TELEMETRY_HEARTBEAT_AFTER` | `5m` | How long a transfer must run before it also sends periodic heartbeats. `0` disables heartbeats. |
+| `HF_XET_TELEMETRY_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL` | `5m` | Interval between heartbeats once they start. |
+| `HF_XET_TELEMETRY_REQUEST_TIMEOUT` | `5s` | Time budget for one telemetry request, including connection setup. |
+| `HF_XET_TELEMETRY_FINAL_FLUSH_TIMEOUT` | `2s` | How long a finished transfer waits for its summary to be delivered. `0` sends it fully detached. |
+| `HF_XET_TELEMETRY_MAX_IN_FLIGHT` | `32` | Process-wide cap on concurrent telemetry requests; summaries beyond it are dropped. |
